{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3164","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3164","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3164\",\"parent_revision\":\"622d36f0eef8017652ed0803132a1aea42435a678df0e689f1ab3ff6f775fc5c\",\"root_revision\":\"622d36f0eef8017652ed0803132a1aea42435a678df0e689f1ab3ff6f775fc5c\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-22\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n`backlog_core/tests/unit/progressive_markdown/test_indexer_decomposition.py::TestPLRLintGate::test_indexer_build_passes_plr_complexity_gates` fails with `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'ruff'`.\\n\\nThe test shells out to a `ruff` binary that is not present on PATH in the environment the standalone plugin runner creates. It fails identically on a branch and on a clean `main`, and reproduced independently in three separate agent sessions, each of which recorded it as a pre-existing failure unrelated to their change.\\n\\nObserved 2026-08-22 and 2026-08-23. The rest of the suite passes: roughly 4442 passed, 42 skipped, 5 xfailed alongside it.\\n\\nImpact: every agent running the plugin suite sees a red result it must first diagnose and then decide to ignore. A permanently-failing test trains readers to discount failures, and hides a genuine regression in the same file behind a known-red line. It also means the lint gate this test exists to enforce is not actually being enforced in that environment \u2014 the test cannot be measuring what it claims when the binary it measures with is absent.\\n\\nNot established: whether the fix is to declare the dependency in the runner's environment, to invoke the linter through the project's managed environment rather than a bare binary lookup, or to skip the test when the binary is unavailable. The third would silence the signal rather than restore the gate.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation \u2014 reproduced independently in three agent sessions, 2026-08-22 and 2026-08-23\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"63c6a9db49e7b23c9c42bbdb4936bde4ca951f7fc82ac308d7f5b1fcadd92b45\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABQN33TA\"}"}